/* ==UserStyle==
@name           Stylish Dark Menu
@namespace      USO Archive
@author         drunkguard
@description    `<div>Does one job: makes your Stylish popup menu dark. ( ͡° ͜ʖ ͡°)<div id="headline" style="color:Tomato;">This style doesn't work on Firefox because of Firefox API changes recently.</div></div><style>#preview_image_div{transition:0.3s}#preview_image_div:hover{transform:scale(1.03)}#actions_div{position:sticky;top: 70px;padding:10px; background:#e8e8e8;border: 1px solid #d0d0d0;border-radius:7px}#install_style_button{background-color:#333333;border:1px solid #7d7d7d}</style>`
